// dungeon_layout — Warrior AOE swing + Brute's wide cleave. AbilityId 2
// (alphabetical: after Backstab=1, before Heal=3).
// AOE damage in spread(radius, max_targets) — friendly-fire by default
// per the AOE Path B gotcha; the verb's `when` gate filters the cast
// site (caster) but the radius walk hits every alive agent in-radius.

ability Cleave {
    target: enemy
    range: 4.0
    cooldown: 6
    hint: damage

    damage 12.0 in spread(3.5, 6) [PHYSICAL: 100]
}
